#. 石丸クンは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Taka?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それはっ！
msgctxt "0002 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "I saw...!"
msgstr ""

#. す、すまない……！
#. 口にするには、心の、準備が…必要だっ！
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Sorry... It's gonna take me some time to figure out\n"
"how to put it into words..."
msgstr ""

#. みんな…動揺してるよね…
msgctxt "0004 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Everyone's really upset..."
msgstr ""

#. 冷静になんて…なれないよね…
msgctxt "0005 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I mean, how could anyone be calm right now?"
msgstr ""

#. なんで…あんな映像があるの…？
#. わかんない、わかんないよぉ……
msgctxt "0006 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Why...? How can something like that even exist? I just\n"
"don't understand. I don't..."
msgstr ""

#. こんな事が…できるのも……
#. 殺人鬼、だから…なのかな…
msgctxt "0007 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"To be able to do something like that... Is it because\n"
"they really are the murderous fiend?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っち！　こんな映像はでっち上げだべ？
#. なぁ、そうだべ！？
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, Makoto! These videos are some kinda hoax, right?\n"
"Right!?"
msgstr ""

#. そう思いたい…けど……
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I want to think so. But..."
msgstr ""

#. な、何を言ってるだべ！
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wh-What the hell, man!?"
msgstr ""

#. デタラメだべ、そうだべ！
#. ははははは……
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "This is all one big lie! It has to be! Hahaha...!"
msgstr ""

#. うぅ……
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Urg..."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Kyoko?"
msgstr ""

#. ……………
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 話す必要はないわ。
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Why should I tell you?"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Sakura?"
msgstr ""

#. ……………
msgctxt "0017 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …我の家族の映像だ。
msgctxt "0018 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "My family."
msgstr ""

#. だが、それしきの事では我は動揺せん。
msgctxt "0019 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "But I'm not upset by what I saw."
msgstr ""

#. 力で負けたなら死は受け入れねばならん。
#. それが我が一族の流儀だ。
msgctxt "0020 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you're overpowered, you must accept your death.\n"
"That is the way of my family."
msgstr ""

#. だが…我が家族がそう簡単に負けたとも思えん…
#. おのれ…どうやって…？
msgctxt "0021 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But still...I refuse to believe they would lose so\n"
"easily. How...?"
msgstr ""

#. 山田クンは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Hifumi?"
msgstr ""

#. ぬ、ぬぬぬぬぬ…
msgctxt "0023 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ngh...grnnngh..."
msgstr ""

#. 他人に聞く前に、
#. 自分が見たモノを言うのが礼儀ですぞ？
msgctxt "0024 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"Before you go asking someone else, it's only polite\n"
"that *you* say what *you* saw first, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクは……
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, I—"
msgstr ""

#. …って、どうして耳をふさぐんだよ。
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Why are you covering your ears?"
msgstr ""

#. 聞かなければ言わないでいい！
#. これぞ、見ざる聞かざる言わざるの術！
msgctxt "0027 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"If I don't hear yours, I don't have to say mine! It's\n"
"the art of see no evil, hear no evil, speak no evil!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>違うと思う……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think that's how it works...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木もさぁ、気にならなかった？
#. 他の人の映像…
msgctxt "0029 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Hey Makoto, aren't you like super curious what's in\n"
"everyone's videos?"
msgstr ""

#. 気にならない……訳じゃないけど。
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I mean...I can't say I'm *not* curious..."
msgstr ""

#. でっしょ？
#. だから、言ったじゃん！
msgctxt "0031 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Right? I could totally tell!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、自分のもちゃんと言う気ある？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But...does that mean you're gonna tell me what was in\n"
"yours?"
msgstr ""

#. さあー？
#. そういうのって、気分によるじゃん？
msgctxt "0033 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Hmm, who knows? It all depends what kinda mood I'm in,\n"
"ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>言う気ないな、これは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think she's gonna tell me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. セレスさんは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Celeste?"
msgstr ""

#. あら…
msgctxt "0036 | CELES"
msgid "Oh, it is you."
msgstr ""

#. 聞きたいですか？
msgctxt "0037 | CELES"
msgid "You really want to know, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そ、その笑顔が…逆に怖い…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Th-That smile... It's strangely scary.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 世の中、知らない方がいい事って
#. 案外、多くありましてよ？
msgctxt "0039 | CELES"
msgid ""
"There are many, many things in this world you are\n"
"better off not knowing, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. 大和田クンは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Mondo?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、ああん！？
msgctxt "0041 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "H-Huh!?"
msgstr ""

#. た、大した…もんじゃねえ…！
msgctxt "0042 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Oh, it doesn't matter. It's not a big deal!"
msgstr ""

#. あんなの、黒幕ってのが勝手に作った
#. ニセモンに決まってらぁ！
msgctxt "0043 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"It was fake, anyway. It had to be! Whoever's doing all\n"
"this just pulled it out of his ass!"
msgstr ""

#. そうなんだよ！
#. わかったかよ、苗木！
msgctxt "0044 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's gotta be it! Those assholes can't fool\n"
"me!"
msgstr ""

#. 十神クンは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Byakuya?"
msgstr ""

#. ……ふん。
msgctxt "0046 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...Hmph."
msgstr ""

#. 話す必要がどこに？
#. そんな事もわからないのか、眠たい男だ。
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Where is it written I have to tell you? You wouldn't\n"
"understand anyway. Now leave me alone. You bore me."
msgstr ""

#. 言わねーぞ！
msgctxt "0048 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "I'm not sayin' nothin'!"
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 言わねーからな！
#. 絶対に！　言わねーってんだよ！
msgctxt "0050 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"I'm not gonna tell you! No way! Hell no! No way in\n"
"hell!"
msgstr ""

#. イイ子ぶって口割らせようってんだろ？
#. その手に乗るかよ！
msgctxt "0051 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"You're just acting all nice so we'll tell you what you\n"
"wanna hear. You can't fool me!"
msgstr ""

#. っくしょう！
#. あんなの、どこで手に入れたんだよぉ！？
msgctxt "0052 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Dammit! How the hell did they get footage of that...!?"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園ちゃん…どこ行っちゃったんだろ…
msgctxt "0053 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Where'd Sayaka run off to...?"
msgstr ""

#. それに…さっきの、よくできた映像だったね…
#. 本物かと、思っちゃった……
msgctxt "0054 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, that video was pretty convincing. I almost\n"
"thought it was real..."
msgstr ""

#. ……ねつ造…だよね？
#. 偽物に、決まってる……よね？
msgctxt "0055 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But it's fake, right? It's gotta be!"
msgstr ""

#. そう思いたい、けど……
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd like to believe that, but..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もし本当なら……！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If it *was* real...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. は、話さない……わよ……
msgctxt "0058 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I-I don't wanna talk about..."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうせ、あたしなんて…
msgctxt "0059 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "And I'm sure you d-don't wanna hear it..."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうしても聞きたいってのなら…
#. 他の人を…説得しなさいよ…！
msgctxt "0060 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"But if y-you really insist, you need to convince\n"
"everyone e-else to talk first!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、このモニター…！
#. どこの会社が作ってるんだよ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What kind of monitor is this!? Who would even make\n"
"this kind of thing!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …モノクマ社って書いてある。
#. ディティールにこだわってんな…
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It has \"Monokuma Co.\" written across it. I guess\n"
"they've covered all the details..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで見られていると思うと、
#. 気分が悪いけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hate the idea that someone might be watching me\n"
"right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>校則によると、監視カメラを壊したらマズイんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to keep in mind that it's against school\n"
"regulations to mess with any of the cameras.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As much as it gets on my nerves, I'd better leave it\n"
"alone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ん…？　ダンボール箱の中に何か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? There's something inside this cardboard box.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こ、これって…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ＤＶＤみたいですね。しかも…
msgctxt "0069 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "...a bunch of DVDs."
msgstr ""

#. ラベルに、みんなの名前が書いてありますけど…
msgctxt "0070 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "And each one has a label on it with someone's name."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマの言ってた<CLT 3>“ある映像”<CLT>って、
#. きっとこれの事だよ…
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"This must be the \"<CLT 3>video for each of us<CLT>\" he\n"
"mentioned..."
msgstr ""

#. 私、みんなを呼んで来ますね！！
msgctxt "0072 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "I'd better go tell everyone!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すぐに、舞園さんは走り出した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She just ran off...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは彼女の後は追わず、
#. その場に１人残っていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I didn't follow after her. I just stood right there\n"
"where I was.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>というより、目の前のＤＶＤに意識を奪われ、
#. その場を動けずにいたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The DVDs in front of me had robbed me of all\n"
"awareness. I was rooted in place...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ここに…何が映ってるんだ……？
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I think I see something..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ＤＶＤが入っていたダンボール箱だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the cardboard box the DVDs were in.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モニターと映像再生機器がセットになっている。
#. ＤＶＤなんかが再生出来そうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Next to the monitor is a high-end DVD player. It\n"
"should be able to play DVDs.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、ＤＶＤのソフトは見当たらない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I don't see any actual discs nearby...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. デッキだけあっても、意味ないよ…
#. 何か見られたら気晴らしにもなるのに。
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"A DVD player is useless by itself. If we had something\n"
"to watch, at least that'd help pass the time."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モニターと映像再生機器がセットになっている。
#. ここで、あのＤＶＤも確認出来そうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Next to the monitor is a high-end DVD player. It'll\n"
"probably play those DVDs no problem.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. みんなが来る前に…
#. 自分のだけでも確認しておこうかな…
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'll just watch mine real quick, before everyone\n"
"else gets here."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ダンボール箱から、
#. 自分の名前がラベルされたＤＶＤを抜き出すと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I sorted through the DVDs I'd found in the box and\n"
"found the one with my name on it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それを、専用のデッキへと挿入した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...then I slid it into the expensive-looking player.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モニターの前に腰を落ち着け、
#. しばらく暗いままの画面を観続けていると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I sat down and stared intently at the\n"
"darkened screen. And then...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あっ！！
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Ah—!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは思わず声を上げていた。
#. と同時に、心臓が早鐘を打ち始める。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I yelled out without realizing it, and my heart\n"
"started racing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが見つめているモニターに、
#. 映し出されていたのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because what I saw on that monitor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの家族達の姿だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was my family.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 誠くん…あなたが希望ヶ峰学園に選ばれるなんて…
#. 夢みたいだわ。頑張ってね。
msgctxt "0090 | NAEGI'S MOTHER"
msgid ""
"You getting picked to attend Hope's Peak Academy is\n"
"like a dream come true. Make sure you do your best!"
msgstr ""

#. 自分の息子として誇りに思うぞ。
#. まぁ、でも…無理しすぎないようにな…
msgctxt "0091 | NAEGI'S FATHER"
msgid ""
"I'm so proud of you, son. But remember—don't push\n"
"yourself too hard!"
msgstr ""

#. お兄ちゃん～！　見てる～！？
#. 頑張ってね～！！
msgctxt "0092 | NAEGI'S SISTER"
msgid "Are you really watching this, Makoto? Good luck, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それだけ見れば、ただの応援メッセージだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If it had ended there, that would've been fine. A\n"
"message of love and support.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望ヶ峰学園に入学したボクを励ましてくれる、
#. 家族の応援メッセージ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After leaving my family behind to attend Hope's Peak,\n"
"it would have given me hope, given me strength.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今、置かれている状況が普通の学園生活だったなら、
#. 照れくさいながらも嬉しかったに違いない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If this was a normal school, I would've been happy, if\n"
"a little embarrassed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>家族の応援を背に、
#. この学園での飛躍を誓ったに違いない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With my family's support to rely on, I would've been\n"
"motivated to do even better.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…今は違う……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But here, now, it was totally different.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが置かれているのは、ただの学園生活じゃない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I *wasn't* living an ordinary school life.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから…この映像だって、
#. このまま終わるはずがない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I had a pretty strong feeling that the video wasn't\n"
"going to end there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、そんなボクの嫌な予感は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I hated having that feeling, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…見事に的中してしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...it turned out I was absolutely right.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ッ！！
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今度は、声を上げる事も出来なかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This time, I couldn't even make a sound.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただ声を失った…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My voice just...died.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…みんなはどこに消えた？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0105 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Where'd everyone go...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ここで戦闘でも起きたのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like a warzone or something...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな疑問に答えるかのようなタイミングで、
#. モニターから流れ出してくる声…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As if in reply, a voice came floating out of the\n"
"speakers.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>聞き覚えのある…あの声…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I recognized the voice, of course. It was *him*...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 希望ヶ峰学園に入学した苗木誠クン…
#. そんな彼を応援していたご家族のみなさん。
msgctxt "0109 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Makoto Naegi, accepted into Hope's Peak Academy. And\n"
"his family, who supported such a lucky boy..."
msgstr ""

#. どうやら…そのご家族の身に何かあったようですね？
msgctxt "0110 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But it seems like...something's happened to this\n"
"family's well-being!"
msgstr ""

#. では、ここで問題です！
#. このご家族の身に何があったのでしょうかっ！？
msgctxt "0111 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Oh boy, this is bad! What could have possibly happened\n"
"to this family's well-being!?"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どういう事だよ……
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What is this?"
msgstr ""

#. どうして、みんながッ！？
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What happened to everyone!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>震えが止まらなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I started trembling...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>恐怖…怒り……
#. それらの感情がマグマのように沸き上がり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I could feel the fear and anger building up inside me,\n"
"like hot magma.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. くっそぉぉぉぉおおおおッ！！
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "GOD DAMMIT!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>机を拳で何度か叩いた後、
#. 次に、ボクの頭に浮かんだのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I slammed my fist against the desk over and over\n"
"again. A single thought was racing through my mind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…当然と言えば当然の考えだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0118 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What else? How could I think about anything else?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 出なきゃ……
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I have to get out of here."
msgstr ""

#. 今すぐ、ここから出なきゃ！
#. みんなの無事を確かめに行かないとッ！！
msgctxt "0120 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I have to get out, right now! I need to make sure\n"
"everyone's safe!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木…君…？
msgctxt "0121 | NO NAME"
msgid "Makoto...?"
msgstr ""

#. どうしたんですか…？　みんなの無事って…？
msgctxt "0122 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "What happened? Make sure who's safe?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>気付けば、視聴覚室のドアの前には、
#. ボクに困惑の眼差しを向けているみんなの姿があった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I noticed everyone standing around the entrance to the\n"
"A/V room. They stared at me, faces full of confusion.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、何か…あったの…？
msgctxt "0124 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh-What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは無言のまま、
#. 教壇の上にあるダンボール箱を指さした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without a word, I pointed to the cardboard box.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマが言ってたのって…これの事？
msgctxt "0126 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Is that what Monokuma was talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. ここに…何が映っていると言うのだ…？
msgctxt "0127 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "What's on them?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一斉にダンボール箱に群がった彼らは、
#. そこからＤＶＤを奪い取ると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They all gathered around the box, and each of them\n"
"grabbed the DVD with their name on it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>即座にモニターへと走った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One by one, they each rushed to a monitor.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな彼らの顔色が豹変するのに、
#. 時間はかからなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It didn't take long for them to react.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだよ…こりゃ…？
msgctxt "0131 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "What the fuck...?"
msgstr ""

#. こ、これ…本物じゃないよね…？
#. ねつ造…だよね？
msgctxt "0132 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Th-This can't be real, right? It has to be fake,\n"
"right!?"
msgstr ""

#. ほ、本物の訳ねーって…
#. ハハ…そんな訳ねーじゃん。
msgctxt "0133 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Yeah, no way it's real. Haha...no way."
msgstr ""

#. もう…イヤ………
msgctxt "0134 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I can't t-take it anymore..."
msgstr ""

#. もうイヤァ！　ここから出してぇええッ！！
msgctxt "0135 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I c-can't take this anymore! Let me out of h-here!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その反応を見ただけでわかった。
#. みんな…ボクと同じような映像を見させられたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As soon as I saw their reactions, I knew... They'd all\n"
"seen something like what I'd seen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう誰も…恐怖と混乱を隠そうとはしなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0137 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nobody even bothered trying to hide their fear and\n"
"confusion.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、そんな中でも、
#. なぜか彼女は冷静なままで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0138 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Except for *her*. Even now, she was totally calm.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なるほどね…
#. これが、あいつの言っていた<CLT 3>“動機”<CLT>の意味…
msgctxt "0139 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I see... So this is what he meant by <CLT 3>motive<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 私達の<CLT 3>“出たいという気持ち”<CLT>を煽って、
#. 殺し合いをさせようとしているのね…
msgctxt "0140 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He wants to fuel our <CLT 3>desire to leave<CLT> so that we're\n"
"more likely to start killing each other."
msgstr ""

#. 囚人のジレンマ…ですわね。
msgctxt "0141 | CELES"
msgid "It is the classic \"prisoner's dilemma.\""
msgstr ""

#. …なんて？
msgctxt "0142 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 例えば、軍事開発に置き換えて考えてみましょう。
msgctxt "0143 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Let me use an example. Imagine two countries are on\n"
"the brink of war."
msgstr ""

#. Ａ国とＢ国は平和維持を望み、
#. 共に軍事開発を止めようと考えています。
msgctxt "0144 | CELES"
msgid ""
"But both countries want peace, and each commits to\n"
"scaling back their forces as a sign of good faith."
msgstr ""

#. ですが、相手国に裏切られ、
#. さらなる軍事開発を進める恐怖に耐え切れず…
msgctxt "0145 | CELES"
msgid ""
"But there's a chance that one country may betray the\n"
"other, so each country fears lowering their guard."
msgstr ""

#. 結果、双方とも軍事開発を推し進めていってしまい、
#. 互いに裏切り合う結末を迎える。
msgctxt "0146 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The result is that neither scales back their forces,\n"
"and they both end up betraying each other."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、見えない裏切りの恐怖こそが、
#. 均衡状態の最大の敵となるのです。
msgctxt "0147 | CELES"
msgid ""
"In other words, the fear of invisible treachery\n"
"becomes the greatest enemy of stability."
msgstr ""

#. い、今の…あたし達みたいって事ね…
msgctxt "0148 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "That kinda sounds l-like us right now..."
msgstr ""

#. 口では…協力なんて言いつつ…
#. 心の中では…誰かが裏切る恐怖に怯えてる…
msgctxt "0149 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Everyone says they'll work together, but in our hearts\n"
"we're all afraid someone might betray us..."
msgstr ""

#. だ、だが、変な考えを起こすんじゃないぞ。
#. それこそ黒幕の思う壺だぞ！
msgctxt "0150 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Don't put those awful thoughts in our head! That's\n"
"exactly what they *want* us to do!"
msgstr ""

#. …んな事言って、オメーこそ、
#. みんなを油断させた隙にって考えてるんじゃ…
msgctxt "0151 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"You can say that, but maybe you're thinking that once\n"
"everyone drops their guard, you can just..."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだとっ！？
msgctxt "0152 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

#. そうやって争う事こそ、
#. 黒幕の狙いなのだとわからんのか？
msgctxt "0153 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"This is exactly what Monokuma, or whoever's behind\n"
"this, wants. They *want* us to fight. Don't you see?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだよ…冷静にならないと…
msgctxt "0154 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Yeah, you're right. We all need to calm down..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあさ…
#. まずは、お互いに話し合ってみるってのは？
msgctxt "0155 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Okay, then. Maybe we should start by all\n"
"just...talking."
msgstr ""

#. 自分がどんな映像を見せられたのか…
#. きっと話した方が楽になるしさ…
msgctxt "0156 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid ""
"Maybe if we all just talk about what we saw, that'll\n"
"help get everything out of our system."
msgstr ""

#. それに…ちょっと気になるじゃん？
msgctxt "0157 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "Besides, I think we're all super curious, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなが…どんな映像を見させられたのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0158 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder what was in everyone's videos...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに…気にならないと言ったら、
#. ウソになるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd be lying if I said I wasn't curious.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、舞園さん…
msgctxt "0160 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0161 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 舞園さんは…どんな映像を見せられたの？
msgctxt "0162 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What was in your video, Sayaka?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0163 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ど、どうしたのよ…さっさと言いなさいよ……
msgctxt "0164 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What's wr-wrong? Just hurry up and t-tell us..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0165 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ……舞園…さん？
msgctxt "0166 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sayaka?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、彼女の肩にそっと手を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0167 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I gently placed my hand on her shoulder.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …やめてッ！！
msgctxt "0168 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "...Stop it!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの手を振りほどくのと同時に、
#. 彼女は走り出していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0169 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She pushed my hand away and suddenly ran off.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園ちゃんッ！？
msgctxt "0170 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Sayaka!?"
msgstr ""

#. 放っておけ…
msgctxt "0171 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Let her go."
msgstr ""

#. ほ、放っておけないよ！
msgctxt "0172 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-I can't do that!"
msgstr ""

#. ボク、捜しに行ってくる！！
msgctxt "0173 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I have to go make sure she's okay!"
msgstr ""

#. ラブコメなんて…気色悪いわ…
#. あ、あたしは知らないわよ…
msgctxt "0174 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I h-hate romantic comedies like this. I don't care\n"
"what h-happens to her, personally..."
msgstr ""

#. アンタって、マジで無責任ね！
msgctxt "0175 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (MUKURO)"
msgid "That's because you're totally thoughtless!"
msgstr ""

#. 私も…心配だよ…
msgctxt "0176 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm...really worried."
msgstr ""

#. では、お好きなようになされば？
#. 全員の足並みをそろえずとも良いでしょう？
msgctxt "0177 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Then why don't you go do whatever you think you have\n"
"to? We don't all have to stick around together, right?"
msgstr ""

#. わたくしも好きなようにしますから。
#. ごきげんよう…
msgctxt "0178 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Speaking of which, I have my own things to take care\n"
"of. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんな…バラバラだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0179 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Everyone went their separate ways...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、今はそんな事を
#. 気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0180 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I don't have time to worry about them right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんを捜しに行かないと…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0181 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to go find Sayaka!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…………………
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0182 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君。
#. もうちょっと調べてみませんか？
msgctxt "0183 | SAYAKA MAIZONO"
msgid "We should probably look around a little bit more."
msgstr ""

#. そうだね…映像と言えば、
#. やっぱり、ここだろうし。
msgctxt "0184 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This is where we can play the videos, I think."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>早くＤＶＤの中身を確認しないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0185 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to find out what's on the DVD.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここに…何が映ってるんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0186 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder what's in these videos...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0187 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0188 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0189 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
